<title>UK: BayerVB sets 150 mln Sfr 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 150 mln Sfr 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse and Von Ernst.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    25.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.15    PAY DATE    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  REOFFER    =	   EOS	   10.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED BOND ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
